Friends!

It has been 3 years since The Life and Suffering of Sir Brante narrative-driven RPG was released, immediately winning the love of players and gaining wide popularity in many countries. We want to express our sincere gratitude to you for playing and replaying our title (as many of you have unlocked all endings and achievements!), supporting it, as well as sharing your impressions and feedback. Thank you for loving our characters (yes, we "adore" Grandpa too!), immersing yourselves in the game's universe, and following its development.

It is thanks to you, your help and feedback, that the game has gained such acclaim! So, if you have not yet shared what Sir Brante did for you personally, we would be very glad if you expressed your impressions in a [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/1272160/The_Life_and_Suffering_of_Sir_Brante/]review on our Steam page [/url].

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38127382/849bbac2fee71e12a54efa6b485eaecdd84daa1e.png[/img] [b]Take Part in the Giveaway[/b]

In honor of The Life and Suffering of Sir Brante's anniversary, we are announcing a game key giveaway that will be held on Discord!

Join [url=https://discord.gg/NJfmKSzq6t]our Discord server[/url] and leave a reaction under the giveaway post. On Tuesday, March 5, 10 winners will be randomly selected among those who did so.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38127382/849bbac2fee71e12a54efa6b485eaecdd84daa1e.png[/img] [b]The Life and Suffering of Sir Brante's Achievements[/b]

During the 3 years since its release, a lot of great things happened to the game:[list]
[*] The title has found an incredible resonance in the hearts of players around the world, receiving a huge number of positive reviews across all platforms. At the moment, The Life and Suffering of Sir Brante is steadily maintaining the "Very Positive" rating on Steam, with over 90% of reviews praising the game! We would love to share those we liked the most with you:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38127382/56035702805b115028540fcbd513a9df05b990b9.jpg[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38127382/de17b7788c4da79946322cc35e9b31cfacdc5d1b.jpg[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38127382/28bf0996730f004a0cee9246fda5dd1b774bb459.jpg[/img]
[*] Collectibles have been added in the form of trading cards and Points Shop items;
[*] The game received over 200 positive recommendations from Steam curators;
[*] The game received incredibly high scores (ranging between 85 and 100 points) from respected media outlets and game critics;
[*] The game earned a positive "Green" rating of 82 on Metacritic;
[*] The game won a significant list of awards, including:
- DevGamm Awards Fall 2021 — Excellence in Narrative;
- DevGamm Awards Fall 2021 — Awards Nominee Grand Prize;
- NYX Game Awards 2022 — Grand Winner;
- Stove Indie Awards 2022 by Smilegate — Stove Pick Partner.
[*] The game released on all major PC platforms, key stores, and even a regional online store in Korea;
[*] The game was ported to consoles and released in the PlayStation and Microsoft Stores;
[*] The game was translated into Korean, and we do not even plan to stop there — expect more languages to be supported in the future![/list]The Life and Suffering of Sir Brante was so well received by players that it inspired many to create their own illustrations. Some even wrote their own stories set in the game's universe. This is how the dedicated fans from Flight Of Thought Team came up with the unofficial spin-off about Gregor Brante. Special thanks to the team for their efforts!

As we mentioned in a recent social media post, a new game is coming to The Life and Suffering universe in the future.

Wait for official announcements and news by staying in touch on [url=https://discord.gg/NJfmKSzq6t]our official Discord server![/url]

Hey, friends! The Life and Suffering of Sir Brante went live on the 4th of March, and today we are ready to deploy the very first patch to improve your gaming experience. The update is already available, and here is a shortlist of the main changes it introduced:

- Added subtitles to the short cutscenes in the game;

- Implemented a hint system that will help players determine which skills should be prioritized in order to achieve certain outcomes. Starting from Chapter 3, click the Personality tab and hover your cursor over the question mark icon to learn more. We recommend that you visit this tab as often as possible if you are going for a particular ending;

- Added a visual effect to the Destiny tab that will remind players to check it after important events. As you know, the game sometimes requires the player to plan which events to pursue and what skills to learn. The Destiny tab lists all of the possible outcomes for the selected chapter, as well as their requirements;

- Fixed a number of bugs and errors that sometimes popped up in the later chapters of the game, such as skill points resetting, inability to continue certain chapters or go back to the previous chapter, screen freezes, etc.;

- Fixed a number of story inconsistencies and minor logical errors pointed out in player feedback;

- Fixed most of the reported errors and additionally proofread both English and Russian versions of the game.

Thank you once again for your feedback,
Sever studio
